meta:
  name:
    de: Energiepreise
  identifier: mainz/energiepreise
  metrics:
  - id: Value
    column_id: Value
    quantity: unit_price
    unit: €/MWh
    label:
      de: Value
  sources:
  - name: BEHG § 10 CO2-Preis Brennstoffe
    authority: Brennstoffemissionshandelsgesetz (BEHG), § 10 Abs. 2
    url: https://www.gesetze-im-internet.de/behg/__10.html
    description: 'National CO2 price on heating and road fuels: fixed price 25 / 30
      / 30 / 45 / 55 EUR per tonne of CO2 for 2021 / 2022 / 2023 / 2024 / 2025, and
      a price corridor of 55-65 EUR per tonne for 2026. For 2027 the price mechanism
      is under revision (freeze at the 2026 corridor, or a market-based fixed price
      coupled to EU ETS1); from 2028 the EU ETS2 applies (start postponed from 2027).
      Summary of the legal state: Stiftung Umweltenergierecht, Update CO2-Bepreisung,
      05.12.2025.; Format: Legal text; Licensing: Public; Geographic Coverage: Germany;
      Update Frequency: On amendment; Date Last Updated: 2025-12-05; Updated by: Kausal'
    edition:
    target: data_point
  - name: EBeV 2030 Anlage 2 Teil 4 Standardemissionsfaktoren
    authority: Emissionsberichterstattungsverordnung 2030 (EBeV 2030), Anlage 2 
      Teil 4
    url: https://www.gesetze-im-internet.de/ebev_2030/anlage_2.html
    description: 'Standard CO2 emission factors of fuels under the BEHG, per GJ of
      net calorific value: natural gas 0.0558, LPG 0.0655, light heating oil 0.074,
      diesel 0.074, petrol 0.0729, hard coal (Feinkohlen) 0.0936, lignite briquettes
      0.0992 t CO2/GJ. Converted here to t CO2 per MWh (x 3.6). These are combustion
      factors, not the BISKO life-cycle factors of the balance.; Format: Legal text;
      Licensing: Public; Geographic Coverage: Germany; Update Frequency: On amendment;
      Date Last Updated: 2026-09-24; Updated by: Kausal'
    edition:
    target: data_point
  - name: Kausal Annahme Energiekosten Mainz
    authority: Kausal Ltd
    url:
    description: 'Assumptions made by Kausal to derive energy prices and the CO2 price
      path for the Mainz energy-cost indicator: gap-filling rules for prices the Klimaschutz-Planer
      export does not carry, zero fuel price for carriers that are not purchased,
      and the CO2 price held at 65 EUR per tonne from 2026. Each row states which
      rule applies.; Format: Assumption; Licensing: Public; Geographic Coverage: Mainz;
      Update Frequency: As needed; Date Last Updated: 2026-09-24; Updated by: Kausal'
    edition:
    target: data_point
  - name: Klimaschutz-Planer Energiekosten Mainz 1990-2023
    authority: Landeshauptstadt Mainz -- Grün- und Umweltamt; export from the 
      Klimaschutz-Planer tool
    url:
    description: 'Energy costs in EUR and final energy in MWh by energy carrier and
      sector, not weather-corrected, 1990-2023, exported from the Klimaschutz-Planer
      for Mainz. The ratio of the two in each cell is the price the tool applies to
      that carrier and sector in that year (its national price table), in nominal
      euros. Used for prices only: the quantities in this export are unreliable from
      2019 (see Klimaschutzplaner Export Mainz 1990-2024), but each price is a cost
      divided by the quantity of the same cell, so the fault in the quantity cancels.
      The prices are net of VAT: the export does not say so, but diesel at 145.0 EUR/MWh
      is 1.45 EUR/l before VAT against the ADAC 2023 average of 1.722 EUR/l with it,
      and petrol and household electricity agree the same way.; Attachment: KSPMainz_energycosts_by_energycarriers-sectors_EUR_notweathcorr_19902023.txt;
      KSPMainz_finalenergyuse_by_energycarriers-sectors_MWh_notweathcorr_19902023.txt;
      Format: .txt; Licensing: Provided to the city; not public; Geographic Coverage:
      Germany (national price table), applied to Mainz; Update Frequency: Superseded
      -- no further updates expected; Date Last Updated: 2026-02-13; Updated by: Landeshauptstadt
      Mainz'
    edition:
    target: data_point
  - name: Kohlenimporteure Jahresbericht 2024 Kesselkohle frei Grenze
    authority: Verein der Kohlenimporteure e.V., Jahresbericht 2024, 
      Tabellenteil (after Statistisches Bundesamt, Statistik der 
      Kohlenwirtschaft, BAFA)
    url: 
      https://www.kohlenimporteure.de/files/user_upload/jahresberichte/Jahresbericht-2024-Tabellenteil.pdf
    description: 'Price of steam coal (Kesselkohle) from third countries, free German
      border, in EUR per tonne of hard coal equivalent (t SKE), annual, 1957-2023:
      2019 79, 2020 63, 2021 119, 2022 376, 2023 213 EUR/t SKE. Converted here at
      8.141 MWh per t SKE. The Klimaschutz-Planer industrial hard coal price equals
      this series for 2019 and 2020 and was not updated afterwards. Border price:
      excludes transport to the plant.; Format: .pdf; Licensing: Public; Geographic
      Coverage: Germany; Update Frequency: Annual; Date Last Updated: 2026-09-24;
      Updated by: Kausal'
    edition:
    target: data_point
  index_columns:
  - Year
  - energy_carrier
  - sector
  updated_at: '1790252896'
  units:
    Value: EUR/MWh
